{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は似顔絵会でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/21/2986312/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自称模写なら得意なので、自信満々で参加してきました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっと上手く描けたと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"当たった方、おめでとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/21/2986312/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてゆみ姉が乃木坂メンバーとして最後でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなでいっぱい喋って、ゆみ姉との時間をいっぱい楽しめました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/21/2986312/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"変わらずノリよくておもしろかった(^w^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後までみんな笑顔だったのでよかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆみ姉、卒業おめでとう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寂しくなっちゃうけど、ゆみ姉のこと応援してるよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ご飯食べに行ったりお話したり、また会えるよね。会おうね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもよろしくお願いします(*^o^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/21/2986312/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/erika.ikuta/img/2012/11/21/%E3%81%84%E3%81%8F%EF%BC%91.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここからはお知らせです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"HTCの新機種、HTC J butterfly が発売されることになり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46がCMキャラクターを勤めさせていただくことになりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/21/2986312/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も実際に使用してみたのですが、まず画質がよくてビックリ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"綺麗な写真が撮れて、画面をタッチするごとに感動してました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ズームもすごく近くまでできるんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"性能も素晴らしいですし使い心地もとってもよかったです(^O^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"CMについては、流れ出してから詳しく話しますね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひ楽しみにしててください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/21/2986312/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"HTC J butterfly のよさをたくさん広められたらうれしいな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エリカ(。・∀・。)☆彡"}],"source":"archive"}